// SDIO behavioural card models (mdl_sdio.v/mdl_sdtx.v/mdl_sdcmd.v/mdl_sdrx.v/
// mdl_emmc.v) were removed along with the ZipCPU sdspi submodule swap to
// soclabs/sdio-controller, which does not carry bench/ models. SDIO
// verification is now done via the Synopsys VC-VIP-SOC UVM testbench --
// see top_VIP.flist / uvm_vip_tb.flist.

